pg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri courier is handing three parcels to a man at his doorstep. They are both laughing as if a funny joke or anecdote was shared." width="1000" height="667" class="trustpilot__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-03e10e28><a href="#skip-reviews" class="trustpilot__skip" data-v-03e10e28>skip reviews</a><div class="trustpilot__widget trustpilot-widget trustpilot-slice" data-locale="en-GB" data-template-id="53aa8912dec7e10d38f59f36" data-businessunit-id="620fbe077a2b86af5e54e1a2" data-style-height="140px" data-style-width="100%" data-theme="light" data-stars="4,5" data-review-languages="en" data-font-family="Poppins" data-v-03e10e28><a href="https://uk.trustpilot.com/review/www.evri.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-03e10e28> Trustpilot </a></div></div><span id="skip-reviews" data-v-03e10e28></span></section><section id="looking-for-work-in-bristol?-become-a-self-employed-evri-courier" class="section-wrapper" index="8" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x25bqstJ9-pVF_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1771bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x25bqstJ9-pVF_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1771.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x25bqstJ9-pVF_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1771.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x25bqstJ9-pVF_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1771.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C